flowchart TD
 Form[Title, TipTap HTML, visibility, optional image] --> Guard[Auth and verified middleware]
 Guard --> Validation[StorePostRequest]
 Validation --> Valid{Valid?}
 Valid -->|No| Errors[Back with errors]
 Valid -->|Yes| IsPublish{Visibility published?}
 IsPublish -->|Yes| HasBody{Body non-empty?}
 IsPublish -->|No draft| Upload[Store optional image]
 HasBody -->|No| Errors
 HasBody -->|Yes| Upload
 Upload --> Slug[Generate unique slug]
 Slug --> DB[(Insert Post)]
 DB --> Redirect[Redirect to dashboard]
